---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 pt-3">
    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
        <h1 class="mb-2.5 text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">
          Hello there!
        </h1>

        <p class="text-justify">
          A software developer based in Cabanatuan City, a recent Bachelor of
          Science in Information Technology graduate from{" "}
          <a
            href="https://neust.edu.ph/"
            class="text-emerald-700 hover:underline dark:text-amber-400"
          >
            NEUST
          </a>
          . I also interned at a from{" "}
          <a
            href="https://drpjgmrmc.doh.gov.ph/"
            class="text-emerald-700 hover:underline dark:text-amber-400"
          >
            Public Hospital
          </a>{" "}
          as a tech support and front-end developer. I love tinkering with
          software and figuring out how things work, so much so that for my
          capstone I used varying technologies for the first time as I'm quite
          confident with my ability to adapt. I also like taking ownership of my
          work. Thus, I was almost always the leader for any software
          development project during my time at college. Lastly, I enjoy the
          social aspect that came with the work, especially during my
          internship. I learned the importance of effective and transparent
          communication when handling multiple tasks due to the nature of the
          internship.
        </p>

        <h1 class="mb-2 mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">
          History
        </h1>

        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="before:mr-2 before:content-['>'] before:text-emerald-600 dark:before:text-amber-300">
            2026 (June) - Graduated at Nueva Ecija University of Science and
            Technology | Bachelor of Science in Information Technology
          </li>

          <li class="before:mr-2 before:content-['>'] before:text-emerald-600 dark:before:text-amber-300">
            2026 (May) - Interned at Dr. Paulino J. Garcia Memorial Research and
            Medical Center as Tech Support and Software Developer
          </li>

          <li class="before:mr-2 before:content-['>'] before:text-emerald-600 dark:before:text-amber-300">
            2004 - Born in Cabanatuan, Philippines
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:block w-1/4">
        <img
          src="assets/images/profilePic.JPG"
          alt="Profile Picture"
          class="w-full"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="mb-2 mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">
      Accomplishments
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          src="assets/images/startup.jpg"
          class="w-80 aspect-video object-cover rounded-xl m-4"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">October 31 2024</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-2xl text-emerald-900 dark:text-amber-300">
            1st Place
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/share/p/19LTkgVGJy/"
            class="text-xl underline decoration-2 hover:underline hover:decoration-emerald-400 dark:hover:decoration-amber-200 transition-colors"
          >
            Philippine Startup Challenge 9 Regional Pitching Competition -
            Region III
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          src="assets/images/its.jpg"
          class="w-80 aspect-video object-cover rounded-xl m-4"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">October 17 2025</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-2xl text-emerald-900 dark:text-amber-300">
            3rd Place
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/share/p/1E1EGTrFUE/"
            class="text-xl underline decoration-2 hover:underline hover:decoration-emerald-400 dark:hover:decoration-amber-200 transition-colors"
          >
            RAITE 2025 ITS Cloud Computing Competition
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          src="assets/images/capstone.jpg"
          class="w-80 aspect-video object-cover rounded-xl m-4"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-amber-200">April 28 2026</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-2xl text-emerald-900 dark:text-amber-300">
            Gold Award
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/share/p/1DGPLx3jeU/"
            class="text-xl underline decoration-2 hover:underline hover:decoration-emerald-400 dark:hover:decoration-amber-200 transition-colors"
          >
            Best Capstone for BSIT Major in DST
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="my-2 flex w-full justify-center gap-2 text-emerald-700/50 dark:text-emerald-900">
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="24"
        height="24"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
        <path d="M14.83 14.83a4 4 0 1 1 0-5.66" />
      </svg>
      Nash Andre Berber | 2026
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
